01:44:07,172 --> 01:44:08,842
consistently, every single time.

784
01:44:09,128 --> 01:44:14,971
Treat your security policies with precisely the same testing rigor and discipline you'd apply

785
01:44:15,257 --> 01:44:21,100
to any other piece of genuinely critical production code, because that is, in every

786
01:44:21,387 --> 01:44:24,308
meaningful sense, exactly what they actually are.

